\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Ratios of matched per-case means, A/B: TLS = TCP mTLS/TCP trusted (adaptive); transport = trusted TCP/trusted verbs at the named policy; parking = adaptive/Busy for the named trusted transport. Ratios are not differences or isolated wire/crypto timers. No ratio for failed, unqualified, missing or unmatched partners. Coordinator cache off; lanes one at c1, four at c16; r0/r1 separate. Busy spins owner and coordinator read driver, not kernel busy poll. Unmatched dimensions: TLS/security, polling, RPC/direct I/O; NVMe control is verbs trusted Adaptive.}}{19}{table.caption.28}\protected@file@percent }
