\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {33}{\ignorespaces Order of magnitude only, not an equal-contract comparison. Owner count: one Tidehunter owner versus five Valkey storage nodes. Contract: new puts are Class A page-cache acknowledgement; Valkey SET is Class B \texttt  {appendfsync always}; new read rows have Class B setup but Valkey reads come from RAM; new reads label memory or device service. Fleet: combined or run 13 versus historical external fleets, never the same fleet. Date: new cloud fleets created 12 November 2026; historical contributors span earlier November fleets (per-run dates in \texttt  {historical-topology.csv}). Workload profile: new puts/read-only cells versus Valkey mixed point calls at one caller and pure write/read-concurrent cells at sixteen callers; new repetitions are individual runs, Valkey is a historical median. These differences prevent any ranking. ``Not measured'' is not zero; no value is interpolated. Sources: new-run \texttt  {puts.csv}/\texttt  {reads.csv} and historical \texttt  {populations.csv}, column \texttt  {api\_p50\_us}.}}{29}{table.caption.50}\protected@file@percent }
