\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {45}{\ignorespaces Independent floors ($\mu $s), not additive stages. QD1 append-pwrite/fdatasync and mmap/fsync on both hosts; direct random reads: fresh 2 GiB. Network: blocking eth0 TCP RTT and polled ib\_send\_lat (half RTT doubled). Append controls have r0/r1; network/read floors also r2. No 8 KiB network or 1/8 KiB SSD-read floor; no interpolation. Other modes/regions remain in floors.csv. Failed event-write controls are listed below. Unmatched dimensions: sync/grouping, RPC/security, index/routing, and host SSD (Native coordinator SSD versus owner SSD). Read lanes: Native 0, owner 1 at c1/c5 and 4 at c16; c5 owner reads are lane-limited, not a transport ranking. Floors are separate populations.}}{56}{table.caption.70}\protected@file@percent }
